      "translation": {
        "english_text": "You said you were a servant, you masquerader! Wretch! That lust is surging in your eyes! That poison is dripping from the corners of your lips! With these, you have shattered my trust atom by atom, palace demon!",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The source's escalating insults are preserved as rhetoric; exact Tamil forms remain in the immutable record."
        ]
      }
    },
