            "pdf_page": 10,
            "printed_page": 9
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "I am leaving, but I do not intend to go empty-handed. I will leave only after plucking out those eyes that inflamed me with desire and drove me mad! Not content with leaving the man who trusted you stranded midstream, you ordered him to leave; I will leave only after tearing out that iron heart. (He strangles her.)",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The source-owned parenthetical action remains inside the immutable dialogue-linked unit."
        ]
      }
    },
